<title>UK: Hankyu sets 10 billion yen convertible Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Hankyu sets 10 billion yen convertible Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible issue was announced by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HANKYU CORP</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN YEN   COUPON     1.50	MATURITY   *30.SEP.06</p>
<p> TYPE    CONVERTIBLE  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN  FULL FEES   2.50</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (M) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   GROSS-UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50/0.50 SELL CONC  1.50     PRAECIPUUM  0.35</p>
<p> NOTES     *PUT AT 101.50 ON 30.SEP.03.</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PREMIUM -- 15 PCT, PRICING BY 04.OCT.</p>
<p>		CONVERSION PERIOD - 29.OCT.96-22.SEP.06</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
